            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "icon": "headset",
            "no_padding": true,
            "content": "<p>You can reach out to us through our [contact channels, e.g., email form, contact page] with any feedback or questions you may have. We'll respond as soon as possible during our regular business hours.</p>",
